{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02093",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 6.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.72,
      "end_seconds": 13.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.14,
      "end_seconds": 27.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "Actually, mainly a hot red swollen big toe. There's a couple of other things, but that's the the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.27,
      "end_seconds": 30.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "So, since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.28,
      "end_seconds": 39.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "it's been three days now i didn't want to make a fuss, you know, you know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.72,
      "end_seconds": 43.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "sure how troublesome is it it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.3,
      "end_seconds": 46.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "mostly severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.15,
      "end_seconds": 50.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.58,
      "end_seconds": 60.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Not being able to wear a shoe goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.88,
      "end_seconds": 64.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Has there been pain that woke you too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.27,
      "end_seconds": 79.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two days. The not being able to wear a shoe? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.77,
      "end_seconds": 86.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "have you had a hot red swollen big toe before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.4,
      "end_seconds": 94.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.5,
      "end_seconds": 98.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, rash or injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.53,
      "end_seconds": 101.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.17,
      "end_seconds": 106.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.41,
      "end_seconds": 112.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.45,
      "end_seconds": 115.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.05,
      "end_seconds": 125.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.17,
      "end_seconds": 130.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.78,
      "end_seconds": 134.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.98,
      "end_seconds": 138.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.6,
      "end_seconds": 145.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.08,
      "end_seconds": 167.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.06,
      "end_seconds": 169.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.45,
      "end_seconds": 190.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.66,
      "end_seconds": 197.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Ibuprofen. I take it 400 milligrams, three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.23,
      "end_seconds": 199.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.4,
      "end_seconds": 203.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "About two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.14,
      "end_seconds": 208.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.16,
      "end_seconds": 220.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "Erm, you know, yes, naproxen. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.96,
      "end_seconds": 232.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.94,
      "end_seconds": 241.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.21,
      "end_seconds": 269.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse is 67 beats a minute, temp 36.6 degrees, pressure 128 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.05,
      "end_seconds": 275.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "right, let's have a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.02,
      "end_seconds": 279.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "alright, raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.81,
      "end_seconds": 293.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "The big toe joint is red, hot, swollen and exquisitely tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.92,
      "end_seconds": 303.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "you can sit up now. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably an acute gout attack"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.83,
      "end_seconds": 306.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.11,
      "end_seconds": 337.03,
      "duration_seconds": 29.92,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the the moment I'd say it's an acute gout attack, and we'll know more once the a uric acid blood test is back i'm gonna order a uric acid blood test, for gout it's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture i'll request kidney function tests, it'll help with gout treatment rest the foot, ice it, and drink plenty of water; limit beer and red meat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.05,
      "end_seconds": 345.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.7,
      "end_seconds": 347.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.05,
      "end_seconds": 351.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.38,
      "end_seconds": 353.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.77,
      "end_seconds": 358.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.9,
      "end_seconds": 366.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "That's clear, uh, thanks."
    }
  ]
}